{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>C:aged is a short visual novel with multiple endings, hundreds of branching paths and where your choices do matter.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPOILER: The following text will reveal story information that may spoil the mystery of the game.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where are you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is this place? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where is the game that you are wanting to play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All these questions are likely on your mind as you stare at a slow stream of falling symbols, but then...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/239c446dd2ad9c00af4ceb6c25b5dbfa.poster.webp?t=1751363218\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/239c446dd2ad9c00af4ceb6c25b5dbfa.webp?t=1751363218\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is this girl? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is her role here? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is she so evasive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why won't she let you play the game? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mystery deepens as you get sidetracked in odd conversation after odd conversation, each time getting no closer to the game you are expected to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/6af5c529df2b4fb2467928b0064aba36.poster.webp?t=1751363218\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/6af5c529df2b4fb2467928b0064aba36.webp?t=1751363218\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl reassures you, telling you the game is on its way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anytime now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just a second more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is coming and you will play it soon. Honest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/25fe22a5b4bd6380cc4f6ef1ae567419.poster.webp?t=1751363218\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/25fe22a5b4bd6380cc4f6ef1ae567419.webp?t=1751363218\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As time progresses, she may open up to you. But be careful, you may not feel comfortable with what she reveals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838500?t=1751363218","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838500?t=1751363218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/1c077387041943bd7f9e24003c1dbc9fb54bb5e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751363218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/1c077387041943bd7f9e24003c1dbc9fb54bb5e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751363218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>C:aged is a short visual novel with multiple endings, hundreds of branching paths and where your choices do matter.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPOILER: The following text will reveal story information that may spoil the mystery of the game.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where are you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is this place? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where is the game that you are wanting to play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All these questions are likely on your mind as you stare at a slow stream of falling symbols, but then...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/239c446dd2ad9c00af4ceb6c25b5dbfa.poster.webp?t=1751363218\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/239c446dd2ad9c00af4ceb6c25b5dbfa.webp?t=1751363218\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is this girl? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is her role here? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is she so evasive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why won't she let you play the game? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mystery deepens as you get sidetracked in odd conversation after odd conversation, each time getting no closer to the game you are expected to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/6af5c529df2b4fb2467928b0064aba36.poster.webp?t=1751363218\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838500/extras/6af5c529df2b4fb2467928b0064aba36.webp?t=1751363218\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl reassures you, telling you the game is on its way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anytime now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just a second more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is coming and you will play it soon. Honest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/